  <item>
    <title>房产中介的黑色经济学：ABC单/拖延流/吃差价全拆解 |沪上金牌中介 柚子</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/680915007a449ae8584ef5f4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">680915007a449ae8584ef5f4</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 23 Apr 2025 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>真希望你能在买房/卖房之前听到本期~</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>也欢迎加入i人浓度很高的听友群</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiK7bg1AKH20-Cb3Fr7FAKNyG_Lj.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>|本期嘉宾| 柚子</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>近10年房产中介行业经验</span></p><span></span><p><span>沪上10家中介门店股东</span></p><span></span><p><span>1年购1套房的杠杆游戏玩家</span></p><span></span><p><span>自媒体博主“沪上房知道”</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>|时间戳|</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="74">01:14</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="155">02:35</a> 嘉宾的血泪投资实录</span></p><span></span><p><span>4年购房亏损经历复盘（时机/杠杆率决策失误）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="189">03:09</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="279">04:39</a> 那些已经赚到钱的房产中介的发家方式</span></p><span></span><p><span>▸ ABC单操作流程：下定不过户的价差套利模型 ，利用时间差制造价格波动空间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="310">05:10</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="485">08:05</a> 上海房价坐标系</span></p><span></span><p><span>▸ 总价梯度分析（100万-过亿房源分布）</span></p><span></span><p><span>▸ 中环老破小 vs 外环远大新的决策要素</span></p><span></span><p><span>▸ 内环学区3000万+靠抢</span></p><span></span><p><span>▸ 顶级豪宅全款交易趋势</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="509">08:29</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="615">10:15</a> 房产中介从业者生存现状</span></p><span></span><p><span>▸ 无底薪制下的行业流动性真相</span></p><span></span><p><span>▸ 被拉黑是中介的宿命</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="735">12:15</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1000">16:40</a> 好的房产中介服务评估体系</span></p><span></span><p><span>▸ 需求响应精度</span></p><span></span><p><span>▸ 专业度验证：学区政策/信贷规则压力测试</span></p><span></span><p><span>▸ 诚信度检验：厌恶性设施主动披露测试（垃圾站/高压线）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1000">16:40</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1458">24:18</a> 不良中介的常见套路及如何提前规避</span></p><span></span><p><span>▸ 一房多卖、骗大定等常见操作</span></p><span></span><p><span>▸ 新房带看隐藏的陷阱：AI人脸识别首次带看绑定佣金归属</span></p><span></span><p><span>▸ 返佣承诺风险：小红书渠道客源收割套路</span></p><span></span><p><span>▸ 产调核验黄金三步：</span></p><span></span><p><span>① 随申办人脸识别实时查产权（<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1335">22:15</a>）</span></p><span></span><p><span>② 抵押/查封/租赁状态排查</span></p><span></span><p><span>③ 定金支付前的产证扣押必要性</span></p><span></span><p><span>▸ 吃差价典型案例：单套房源获利17%的路径拆解</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1465">24:25</a>- 跳过房产中介直接成交可以吗</span></p><span></span><p><span>▸ 民法典对跳单行为的界定与规避建议</span></p><span></span><p><span>▸ 一线从业者对现在房市的感受</span></p><span></span><p><span>▸ 法拍房风险预警：20年租约/隐形债务识别</span></p><span></span><p><span>忙碌的Q1导致拖更，主播心情be like：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fmi3t-h6uk56C1ptt-D_lo57CViJ.webp"></figure><span></span><p><span>🚩本期服务区</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：璟怡</span></p><span></span><p><span>制作：西红是番茄</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐：Buddy Guy - What Kind Of Woman Is This</span></p>]]></description>
