    <pubDate>Thu, 07 Nov 2024 21:40:29 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>世界是个巨大的瑞士卷，有人分到瑞士，有人分到卷 。--- 源自网络</span></p><span></span><p><span>IBM的创始人托马斯.沃森曾经说过“一切始于销售”，“没有销售，就没有美国的商业”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在经济波动和就业市场低迷的当下，销售岗位是少数依旧保持开放的职业路径。如果你刚好是岗位新人，或者准备职业转型的朋友，欢迎来听听这期的播客内容～ 轮到销售岗，人生这手牌保底有幅炸！</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜本期嘉宾｜</span></p><span></span><p><span>Ben Wu 本五爷</span></p><span></span><p><span>初代宝洁管培生</span></p><span></span><p><span>把绿箭卖到家喻户晓</span></p><span></span><p><span>世界500强企业首位华人副总裁</span></p><span></span><p><span>投资人</span></p><span></span><p><span>马拉松、越野跑者</span></p><span></span><p><span>现任中国专业运动营养品牌迈胜CEO</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期时间戳由AI生成，感受一下先进生产力，nice！</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间戳：</span></p><span></span><p><span>• <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="130">02:10</a> | 杨笠yes or no，京东这波操作你给几分？</span></p><span></span><p><span>• <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="346">05:46</a> | 市场部与销售部的爱恨纠葛为哪般？</span></p><span></span><p><span>• <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="585">09:45</a> | 销售如何与客户建立信任？</span></p><span></span><p><span>• <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="854">14:14</a> | 如何打开第二曲线，突破销售收入天花板</span></p><span></span><p><span>• <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1395">23:15</a> | 销售新人如何快速成长的职场攻略</span></p><span></span><p><span>• <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1558">25:58</a> | 零资源销售新人如何快速建立人脉？</span></p><span></span><p><span>• <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1758">29:18</a> | I人E人，不同性格如何在职场中找到适合舞台</span></p><span></span><p><span>• <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1868">31:08</a> | 顶尖销售人员的特质有哪些？</span></p><span></span><p><span>• <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1896">31:36</a> | 销售岗新人常犯的错误，提前避坑</span></p><span></span><p><span>• <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1932">32:12</a> | 如何判断一个offer的好坏？</span></p><span></span><p><span>• <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2098">34:58</a> | 如何主动与老板沟通谈涨薪？</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期有粉丝福利！耶～评论区抽取3位留言粉丝，送出价值158元的迈胜酸樱桃液，天然褪黑素，提升舒缓力～</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj2zbGg1SSJNTScenFWnVlMHQOcR.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjGuw6l4DiiaMGssQcRPCDLAFfM9.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期服务区：</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：璟怡</span></p><span></span><p><span>制作：西红柿番茄</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐：under the sun -Everet Almond&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
