    <description><![CDATA[<p><em><strong><span>“</span></strong></em><strong><span>天然这个事还在很早期，各个方向都还有十倍好的可能性</span></strong><em><strong><span>”</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><strong><span>|本期嘉宾|</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>张希伦：</span></p><span></span><p><span>增长黑盒创始人</span></p><span></span><p><span>伦敦帝国理工硕士</span></p><span></span><p><span>《增长工程学》学科开创者</span></p><span></span><p><span>众多五百强企业和一线投资机构的增长顾问</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>时间戳</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="158">02:38</a> Alan的AI行业创业初尝试 - &nbsp;AI Agent</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="298">04:58</a> AI行业的细分发展/搞钱方向— 金字塔模型</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="442">07:22</a> 以ChatGPT为代表的人工智能到底工作原理是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="820">13:40</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;prompt “咒语”是怎么施法的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="875">14:35</a> 随着AI不可阻挡的发展，预期会对普通人的生活会有哪些影响？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1173">19:33</a> 如果AI是第四次工业革命的话，国内现阶段AI发展的优势和阻力是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1373">22:53</a> 已经起航的AI财富巨轮，普通人从哪登船？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1536">25:36</a> &nbsp;新时代下，毕业生面临的就业环境也许是机不是危。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1692">28:12</a> 同为留学生，面对逃不开的回-留课题 怎么选</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1781">29:41</a> 最看好国内哪家的AI发展？（现在买其股票，搓手.gif</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1815">30:15</a> 彩蛋 ：快问快答</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lqfBN1ahXek28TBgXV9krdwzrOnD.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><br></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fkg1i92MYIQz78Hh7KIyFOkVaBQt.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><br></figure><span></span><figure><br></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ftssou-JyQZGlQyrhIZBmOVLCbg6.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>张希伦的一些照片</span></p><span></span><p><span>—————————————————————————————</span></p><span></span><p><span>🚩本期服务区</span></p><span></span><p><span>下雨、回音的茶馆、失智的录音设备、舌头打结的我…… 本期特别感谢后期剪辑师 ，在混乱中抗下了一切使得这期内容的能顺利上线！</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：璟怡</span></p><span></span><p><span>制作：西红柿番茄</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐：Rainy day games - the green orbs</span></p>]]></description>
